---
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro'

import '../assets/styles/fonts.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TurinFlow | Alertas em Tempo Real</title>
    <style>

        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --brand-main: #FFD700;
            --brand-dark: #333;
            --bg-light: #f9f9f9;
            --mid-color1: #bec1b9;
            --mid-color: #131b21;
            --darker-1: #474646;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--darker-1);
            color: var(--brand-dark);
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .external-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 1.75% 3.5%; width: min(100%, 750px); border-top: 1px solid #a537a5; margin-top: 0.6rem;}
        .metric-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 1.75% 3.5%; width: min(100%, 350px); border-top: 1px solid #eee;}
        .metric-label { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #eee; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.1rem; align-content: center; justify-content: center;}
        .metric-value { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;}
        .ui-roadnames { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 200;}
        .align-left1 {text-align: center;}

        .UPPERCASE {text-transform: uppercase;}
        .lowercase {text-transform: none;}
        .names-list span, .traffic-list span {line-height: 1.3rem;}

        .master-1 {display: flex; flex: 0 0 55%; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;}
        .master-2 {display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 3rem}

        .error-btn {
            background: var(--brand-dark);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .header {
            width: 100%;
            vertical-align: top;
            background-color: #a137a5;
            transition: 0.45s ease-in-out;
        }

        .frosted-glass {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
            backdrop-filter: blur(120px) saturate(150%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(150%);
            padding: 1rem;

            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            color: #fff;
            flex: 0 0 100%;
            margin: 0.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
            opacity: 0.99;
            
        }
        
        .border-top {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #fff;
            margin: 0.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
            
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 1.8rem; 
            margin: 0; 
            color: #eeeeee; 
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 2.1rem
        }

        .desktop {opacity: 0;  width: 0;}
        .mobile {opacity: 1}
        .row {flex-direction: column; row-gap: 0.6rem;}
        .mobile-1 {font-size: 18px; line-height: 32px;}
        .space-evenly {justify-content: space-evenly;}
        .footer1 {display: flex; justify-content: center;}

        .button {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #ccc;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: 0.19s ease-in-out;
            padding-left: 0.3rem;
            padding-right: 0.5rem;
            padding-top: 0.1rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.1rem;
            line-height: 29px;
            

        }

        .button:hover {
            background-color: #a537a5;
            transition: 0.19s ease-in-out;
        }
        

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .desktop {opacity: 1; width: auto;}
            .mobile {opacity: 0; display: none}
            .align-left1 {text-align: left;  margin-left: 12px;}
            .space-evenly {justify-content: flex-start;}
            .padding-1 {margin-left: 1.5rem; width: 10rem;}
            .mobile-1 {width: min(150px, 19%); min-width: 10rem;}

            .frosted-glass {
                flex: 0 0 48%;
                margin: 0.6rem;
                border-radius: 8px;
                column-gap: 10rem;
                background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
                opacity: 1;
                transition: 0.28s ease-in-out;
            }

            .frosted-glass:hover {
                background-color: var(--darker-1);
                opacity: 1;
                transition: 0.28s ease-in-out;
            }
            
            .metric-label {
                justify-content: left;
            }

            .row {
                flex-direction: row;
            }

            .header:hover {
                background-color: #9837a5;
                transition: 0.45s ease-in-out;
            }

            .padding-1 {
                padding-bottom: 2rem;
                padding-right: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<script
    src="https://sp.turinflow.com.br/api/script.js"
    data-site-id="3a248a45ee62"
    defer
></script>

<body>

    <!-- THE PRODUCTION DASHBOARD -->
    <Header />
    <div class="row" style="height: auto; display: flex; background-color: var(--mid-color); border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; padding-bottom: 1rem; justify-content: space-evenly;">
        <div class="frosted-glass">
            <div class="border-top a1 title">Visão Geral: Um panorama em tudo.</div>
            <div class="n2" style="margin-top: 0.4rem; padding-top: 0.4rem;">Visão Geral mostra todos os ângulos
            do trânsito em Alphaville, em tempo real. Mostramos o atraso comparado às médias históricas e compilamos
            milhares de fontes de dados em uma simples estatística. Disponível pelo App e pelo site.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frosted-glass">
            <div class="border-top a1 title">Um aliado quando você precisa.</div>
            <div class="n2" style="margin-top: 0.4rem; padding-top: 0.4rem;">O sistema de trânsito em Alphaville
            é altamente imprevisível e complexo. Com Turin, tiramos essa complexidade e o-ilustramos em páginas simples
            de entender e compreender. Focos de trânsito, visíveis em segundos.
            </div>

            <div class="n2" style="margin-top: 0.4rem; padding-top: 0.4rem;">Tudo isso, integrado dentro dos nossos
            aplicativos. Junto às outras funcionalidades implementadas, Turin e o Canarinho está pronto para ser seu aliado
            no seu dia-a-dia, mesmo fora de Alphaville.
            </div>
        </div>


        </div>         
    </div>
    <Footer />
</body>
</html>

